  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core Support Clean Cooking Alliance 2019 - 2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to Clean Cooking Alliance to enable them to carry out activties set out in their strategy for universal adoption of clean cookstoves and fuels. This will, among other things, contribute to the process of revising the CCA&apos;s strategy, drafting a sector-wide strategy for the clean cooking and fuels sector, establishing a country program in Nepal, continued efforts in the Humanitarian field, and market strengthening work etc. Women and girls are the primary target group.</narrative>
  </description>
